goldenland-realestate-v2 issue-tracker workflow (user preference — missing it gets called out): keep a clean working tree, run the full test suite, commit with a clear message, then close the ticket via `gh issue close` with a summary comment; append a context pointer to parent issue #1's 'Implementation Decisions' section (commit SHA, review ledger path, closure date). The code-review skill is a mandatory pre-commit step — two-axis (Standards/Spec) review in parallel sub-agents against HEAD with the originating issue as spec; findings fixed before commit and saved to `docs/agents/reviews/<issue-number>.md`; reviewer may run async — wait for completion before committing. `.pi-subagents/` is pi-generated noise and must be gitignored. Preferred pattern: mirror existing implementations for new tickets (e.g., an existing OpenRouter agent for Complex reused for Property). <!-- created=2026-08-07, last=2026-08-07 -->
